OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do the White House Farm
OL,4,Amurders still grip people 40 years on?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scene had been staged to look like
OL,7,Fa murder-suicide by Bamber's
OL,8,Fschizophrenic sister, Sheila Caffell,
OL,9,Fwho Bamber said then turned the gun on
OL,10,Fherself.
